>> title: Texas Party Potatoes
>> servings: 12
>> cook time: 45 minutes
>> author: Kristin Rodriguez
>> course: side
>> cuisine: American
>> tags: potatoes, party, casserole

Preheat the oven to 350°F.

Combine thawed cubed @frozen hash browns{1%32 oz package}, melted @butter{1/2%cup}, @salt{1%tsp}, @cream of chicken soup{1%can}, @sour cream{1%cup}, diced @onion{1%medium}, and grated @cheddar cheese{2%cups}.

Spread the mixture in a #12x9 inch pan{}.

Crush @corn flakes{2%cups} and mix them with melted @topping butter{1/4%cup}. Sprinkle the topping over the potatoes.

Bake for ~{45%minutes} at 350°F, or until bubbly.
